Historical diagnostic-only ARM64 target trace baseline; no new logic.

Apply after the current kexec_kabi_6.6.89.patch. This packages exactly
the already-built late-boot/source KTT tracer, callers and config. It
writes only the explicitly validated persistent console and stops
before the native ramoops driver. CONFIG_KEXEC_TARGET_TRACE defaults n;
its runtime early parameter and matching reserved-memory validation
are still required. This is diagnostic instrumentation, not a fix.
No head.S, cpu-reset.S or relocation assembly is changed.

